.TH SOCMOND-WATCHDOG 1 "October 2026" "OTA-Pulse" "OTA-Pulse Manual"
.SH NAME
socmond-watchdog \- health watchdog of the OTA-Pulse monitoring daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B socmond-watchdog
[\fB\-\-config\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Monitors the health of the system and of the monitoring daemon and triggers a reboot on failure. It is
started by \fBsocmond-watchdog.service\fR and reads the \fIwatchdog\fR section of
\fI/etc/socmond/config.json\fR.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR socmond (1)
